title: The branch picker lists the local branches and the ones on the remote in folders, and brings a remote branch to local in one click
folders: git-remote-branches, rust-small
expect-file: git-remote-branches/.git/HEAD :: ref: refs/heads/fix/c
expect-file: git-remote-branches/.git/config :: \[branch "fix/c"\]
forbid-log: WARN.*script

wait 3500
left files
wait 1000
ui click 303 120
wait 2000
mark a-picker
wait 2500
ui move 400 429
wait 2000
mark b-bring-to-local
wait 2500
ui click 400 429
wait 2500
mark c-on-the-new-branch
wait 500
quit
